      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n1 Saint Fintan's Terrace, Mountrath, Co.Laois\nA Spacious & Well-Located 3-Bedroom End-of-Terrace Home\n\nSherry FitzGerald Hyland Keating are delighted to present 1 Saint Fintan's Terrace, a spacious three-bedroom end-of-terrace residence ideally positioned overlooking a mature green area in a well-established residential setting.\n\nThis attractive home extends to approximately 89 sq.m. (958 sq.ft.) and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property has been well maintained and benefits from wood pellet stove heating, PVC double-glazed windows, a welcoming living room complete with a pellet stove, a spacious kitchen/dining area, and a versatile home office that could also be utilised as a playroom or study.\n\nUpstairs, the property comprises three generously sized bedrooms together with a family bathroom downstairs. Outside, the home enjoys a low-maintenance front garden enclosed by contemporary fencing, while the fully enclosed rear yard provides excellent privacy and secure off-street access, offering ample space for outdoor entertaining, storage, or future landscaping.\n\nOverlooking a beautifully maintained green area, this home enjoys a peaceful setting while remaining within walking distance of local schools, shops, sporting facilities, and all the amenities the town has to offer. Its convenient location also provides easy access to major road networks, making it an excellent choice for commuters.\n\nWhether you're a first-time buyer, a growing family, or an investor seeking a solid addition to your portfolio, 1 Saint Fintan's Terrace represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious home in a convenient and established location.\n\nAccommodation:\nEntrance Hall\nLiving Room with pellet stove\nHome Office / Study\nKitchen & Dining Area\nFamily Bathroom Downstairs\nThree Bedrooms\nFeatures\nSpacious 3-bedroom end-of-terrace home\nApprox. 89 sq.m. (958 sq.ft.)\nBright living room with pellet stove\nWood Pellet Stove heating\nPVC double-glazed windows\nModern front boundary fencing\nLarge enclosed rear yard with gated access\nHome office/study ideal for remote working\nOverlooking an attractive green area\nWalking distance to schools, shops and local amenities\nExcellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or investors\n\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to secure a comfortable home with excellent potential in a highly convenient location. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
